From: Armada <armada@armada-os.dev>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] skip partitions with no extents

A partition with no extents holds no data, and mapping it takes the name
from a later metadata slot that does populate it.
---
 main.c | 3 ++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/main.c b/main.c
index 5555555..6666666 100644
--- a/main.c
+++ b/main.c
@@ -201,6 +201,10 @@
 			break;
 		}
 
+		// A partition with no extents in this slot holds no data.
+		if (le32toh(parts[i].num_extents) == 0)
+			continue;
+
 		dmt = dm_task_create(DM_DEVICE_CREATE);
 
 		// Prevent out of bounds memory access when concatenating strings
-- 
